/span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cs</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9341em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6124em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{fail}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该路径的失败概率，可以从历史数据按路径类型统计。这项在众包路径上通常显著高于承运商路径，正是它让&quot;高价值订单走承运商&quot;成为数学结论而不是经验判断。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE routing_decision (&#10;  decision_id    BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  order_id       BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  chosen_path    TEXT NOT NULL,        -- locker|crowd|carrier|hybrid_split&#10;  crowd_cost_est    NUMERIC(10,2),&#10;  carrier_cost_est  NUMERIC(10,2),&#10;  locker_cost_est   NUMERIC(10,2),&#10;  crowd_fail_prob   NUMERIC(5,4),&#10;  carrier_fail_prob NUMERIC(5,4),&#10;  expected_total    NUMERIC(10,2),&#10;  decided_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  actual_path    TEXT,&#10;  actual_cost    NUMERIC(10,2),&#10;  actual_outcome TEXT&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_routing_order ON routing_decision (order_id);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> routing_decision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decision_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  chosen_path    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- locker|crowd|carrier|hybrid_split</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  crowd_cost_est    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  carrier_cost_est  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  locker_cost_est   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  crowd_fail_prob   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  carrier_fail_prob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expected_total    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actual_path    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actual_cost    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actual_outcome </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_routing_order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> routing_decision (order_id);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>crowd_fail_prob</code> 与 <code>actual_outcome</code> 是这张表的核心价值：<strong>记录估算时用的概率与最终结果，才能校验概率估计本身对不对</strong>。多数团队只记录决策结果不记录决策依据，导致三个月后想优化成本模型时没有任何数据可用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"众包运力的-可承诺量\">众包运力的&quot;可承诺量&quot;</h3><p>承运商的产能是可以签约锁定的（今日 5000 单），众包不能——你无法承诺&quot;一定有人接&quot;。但可以给众包设定一个<strong>可承诺量</strong>：基于历史同时段的上线人数与接受率，估计出&quot;在给定溢价水平下，可期望承接的单量&quot;，并按分位数保守取值。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>25</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{crowd} = P_{25}\\left( S_{online} \\cdot \\bar{a} \\cdot \\bar{n}_{per\\_courier} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.217em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">25</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用 25 分位数而非均值，是因为超发订单到众包侧的代价（无人接单、订单卡住、买家投诉）远高于少发。这个量值构成混合编排的硬约束：超出它的订单必须落到承运商或柜机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"履约中的动态切换\">履约中的动态切换</h2><h3 id=\"订单卡住时的迁移\">订单卡住时的迁移</h3><p>订单在众包侧卡住（长时间无人接单、司机接单后失联）时，混合编排必须能把它<strong>迁移到另一条路径</strong>。这类迁移的状态机比新建订单复杂，因为已经发生的动作需要被撤销或转移。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; CrowdPool&#10;  CrowdPool --&gt; CrowdAssigned: 司机接单&#10;  CrowdPool --&gt; CarrierFallback: 超时 N 分钟未接单&#10;  CrowdAssigned --&gt; CarrierFallback: 司机失联/取消&#10;  CrowdAssigned --&gt; Delivered: 送达&#10;  CarrierFallback --&gt; CarrierAssigned: 承运商接单&#10;  CarrierAssigned --&gt; Delivered&#10;  CarrierAssigned --&gt; LockerFallback: 派送失败&#10;  LockerFallback --&gt; Delivered: 入柜并通知\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; CrowdPool\n  CrowdPool --&gt; CrowdAssigned: 司机接单\n  CrowdPool --&gt; CarrierFallback: 超时 N 分钟未接单\n  CrowdAssigned --&gt; CarrierFallback: 司机失联/取消\n  CrowdAssigned --&gt; Delivered: 送达\n  CarrierFallback --&gt; CarrierAssigned: 承运商接单\n  CarrierAssigned --&gt; Delivered\n  CarrierAssigned --&gt; LockerFallback: 派送失败\n  LockerFallback --&gt; Delivered: 入柜并通知</pre><p>迁移的工程要点是<strong>幂等与补偿</strong>：如果订单已经打印了面单，迁移时必须作废旧面单并生成新面单；如果已经给买家发了&quot;骑手已接单&quot;的通知，迁移后要发一条更正通知。这些补偿动作必须挂在一个明确的事务边界上，否则会出现&quot;面单作废了但通知没发&quot;的中间态。</p>\n<h3 id=\"交接设施的用法\">交接设施的用法</h3><p>前面 <a href=\"../real-time-dispatch-bid/along-route-batching\">顺路派送与订单聚合</a> 提到，人—人交接的风险高于人—设施交接。混合编排同样受益于这个原则：承运商与小众包之间的包裹转移应该发生在<strong>有存证能力的设施</strong>里（加盟点、驿站、柜机），而不是路边。这样责任划分有据可查，丢失争议可裁决——这是 <a href=\"../crowd-quality-settlement/crowd-proof-delivery-rate\">签收证明与妥投率</a> 里 POD 体系的一部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合网络的质量一致性\">混合网络的质量一致性</h2><h3 id=\"买家侧的体验屏蔽\">买家侧的体验屏蔽</h3><p>买家不应该感知到&quot;这次是众包、上次是承运商&quot;的差异导致的服务水平跳变。工程上有两个手段：<strong>统一的服务承诺口径</strong>（对外只承诺一个达成率，内部按路径分别考核）与 <strong>路径相关的补偿策略</strong>（众包路径延迟的补偿标准更高，因为其基线更差）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"司机的可预期性\">司机的可预期性</h3><p>对众包司机而言，混合编排意味着他看到的订单池包含承运商溢出与平台自有订单两类。这两类的报酬结构可能不同（承运商溢出单可能按件计价，平台单可能含距离费），因此订单卡片上必须<strong>明确展示报酬构成</strong>，否则司机会认为平台在暗中压价。报酬构成的可解释性与 <a href=\"../crowd-quality-settlement/gig-earning-settlement\">众包运力报酬结算</a> 共用同一套费用项定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三类运力的成本曲线形状互补：承运商固定成本高、边际成本低；众包固定成本近零、边际成本波动大；柜机边际成本极低但受点位容量限制。混合是必然而非折中。</li>\n<li>路由判据的顺序是：自提优先（成本最低）→ 时效要求决定承运商还是众包 → 缺口与订单价值决定兜底。</li>\n<li>用期望总成本（含失败概率乘失败成本）比较多条路径，而不是硬编码规则；失败概率按路径类型从历史统计。</li>\n<li>众包侧只能承诺&quot;可承诺量&quot; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{crowd}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，且应按低分位数保守取值，超出的订单必须落到承运商或柜机。</li>\n<li>迁移（众包卡单 → 承运商兜底）必须幂等并带补偿动作（作废面单、更正通知）；包裹转移应发生在有存证能力的设施里。</li>\n<li>对外统一服务承诺口径、内部按路径分别考核；司机侧的订单卡片必须明确展示报酬构成。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"众包与传统承运商混合编排","id":"众包与传统承运商混合编排"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三类运力的成本与时效结构","id":"核心概念-三类运力的成本与时效结构"},{"level":3,"text":"成本曲线的形状差异","id":"成本曲线的形状差异"},{"level":3,"text":"三类运力的分工判据","id":"三类运力的分工判据"},{"level":2,"text":"订单路由的成本模型","id":"订单路由的成本模型"},{"level":3,"text":"显式成本比较而非规则硬编码","id":"显式成本比较而非规则硬编码"},{"level":3,"text":"众包运力的\"可承诺量\"","id":"众包运力的-可承诺量"},{"level":2,"text":"履约中的动态切换","id":"履约中的动态切换"},{"level":3,"text":"订单卡住时的迁移","id":"订单卡住时的迁移"},{"level":3,"text":"交接设施的用法","id":"交接设施的用法"},{"level":2,"text":"混合网络的质量一致性","id":"混合网络的质量一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"买家侧的体验屏蔽","id":"买家侧的体验屏蔽"},{"level":3,"text":"司机的可预期性","id":"司机的可预期性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"司机 App 轨迹与 ETA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdsourced-elastic-lastmile/elastic-capacity-schedule/courier-app-tracking-eta"},"next":{"title":"签收证明与妥投率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crowdsourced-elastic-lastmile/crowd-quality-settlement/crowd-proof-delivery-rate"}}